{"lesson":"alg8-c3-s2-n14","count":9,"exercises":[{"number":"223","source_number":"223","group":null,"text":"223. 下列有限数列是等差数列吗？\na) $7,17,27,37$；\nb) $-17,-7,7,17,27$；\nc) $2,12,22,32$；\nd) $2,22,222$；\ne) $\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{3}{4},\\frac{5}{4},\\frac{7}{4}$；\nf) $\\frac{4}{3},\\frac{4}{5},\\frac{4}{7},\\frac{4}{9}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"224","source_number":"224","group":null,"text":"224. 写出下列等差数列$(a_n)$的前5项，设：\na) $a_1=10$，$d=4$；\nb) $a_1=29$，$d=-5$；\nc) $a_1=1.7$，$d=-0.2$；\nd) $a_1=-3\\frac{1}{2}$，$d=\\frac{5}{6}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"225","source_number":"225","group":null,"text":"225. 求下列等差数列的公差与第6项，已知它们的前2项是：\na) $70,100,\\cdots$；\nb) $240,190,\\cdots$；\nc) $-20,-5,\\cdots$；\nd) $\\frac{1}{3},1,\\cdots$.","figures":[]},{"number":"226","source_number":"226","group":null,"text":"226. 在下面写出的等差数列$(b_n)$里，前2项是未知的，把它们求出来：\na) $b_1,b_2,17,23,29,\\cdots$；\nb) $b_1,b_2,-19,-11.5,-4,\\cdots$.","figures":[]},{"number":"227","source_number":"227","group":null,"text":"227. 设$(x_n)$是等差数列. 通过下面各题里的两项表示它的公差$d$：\na) $x_{10}$与$x_{11}$，\nb) $x_6$与$x_8$，\nc) $x_{20}$与$x_{23}$，\nd) $x_{12}$与$x_{16}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"228","source_number":"228","group":null,"text":"228. 已知等差数列$(c_n)$的两项：\na) $c_6=16$和$c_8=22$，求$c_7,c_5,c_{10}$.\nb) $c_{11}=18$和$c_{13}=8$，求$c_{12},c_9,c_{14}$.","figures":[]},{"number":"229","source_number":"229","group":null,"text":"229. 已知某三角形的角度值成等差数列. 证明三角形的一个角等于$60^\\circ$.","figures":[]},{"number":"230","source_number":"230","group":null,"text":"230. 已知三角形的周长等于$24\\mathrm{cm}$，这个三角形的边长成等差数列，求中间的一条边的长度.","figures":[]},{"number":"231","source_number":"231","group":"复习题","text":"231. 求下列各式的值：\na) $4a^3b^{-5}\\cdot2a^{-4}b^4$，当$a=6.4\\times10^3$，$b=2.5\\times10^{-2}$时；\nb) $(3^{-1}a^{-1}b^2)^2\\cdot9a^3b^{-5}$，当$a=3.7\\times10^2$，$b=1.7\\times10^{-1}$时.","figures":[]}]}
